---
layout: layout.njk
title: "Discovery Worksheet"
description: "The Map step of the Dealer Flywheel Method — ten minutes, in your own words, before we design anything."
permalink: /discovery/
---
<div class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">01 — MAP</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);">Tell us how your store actually works.</h1>
    <p class="sub">Every decision-maker in your store sees this differently, and that's useful — please fill this out yourself rather than as one group answer. Ten minutes, in your own words. Skip anything that doesn't apply.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="discovery">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="disc-wrap">
      <form id="disc-form" class="disc-form">
        <!-- spam trap: hidden from people. Deliberately given a name and label that
             browser autofill won't recognize, so autofill never fills it. -->
        <div class="booking-hp" aria-hidden="true">
          <label for="disc-hpx">Leave this field empty</label>
          <input type="text" id="disc-hpx" name="hp_x9" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" data-lpignore="true" data-1p-ignore>
        </div>

        <div class="disc-block">
          <p class="disc-kicker">About you</p>
          <label class="booking-label" for="disc-business">Business name</label>
          <input class="booking-input" type="text" id="disc-business" name="business" required>

          <label class="booking-label" for="disc-name">Your name</label>
          <input class="booking-input" type="text" id="disc-name" name="respondentName" required>

          <label class="booking-label" for="disc-role">Your role</label>
          <input class="booking-input" type="text" id="disc-role" name="role" placeholder="e.g. Owner, GM, Sales" required>

          <label class="booking-label" for="disc-email">Your email <span class="booking-optional">(optional — in case we have a follow-up question)</span></label>
          <input class="booking-input" type="email" id="disc-email" name="email">
        </div>

        <div class="disc-block">
          <p class="disc-kicker">Priorities &amp; dealbreakers</p>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-matters">In a sentence or two, what do you think matters most to your customers when they're deciding on a vehicle?</label>
          <textarea class="booking-input" id="q-matters" name="q_matters" rows="2" required></textarea>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-keep">What's the one thing your current website does well that we should not lose?</label>
          <textarea class="booking-input" id="q-keep" name="q_keep" rows="2"></textarea>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-frustrate">What frustrates you most about your current website?</label>
          <textarea class="booking-input" id="q-frustrate" name="q_frustrate" rows="2"></textarea>

          <p class="booking-label" style="margin-top:22px;">Rate each of these for your site</p>
          <div class="pri-table" id="pri-table">
            <div class="pri-hd"><div></div><div>Must have</div><div>Nice to have</div><div>Skip it</div></div>
            <!-- rows injected by disc.js from PRI_ITEMS -->
          </div>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-dealbreaker">Anything the site must NOT do or say — a real dealbreaker? <span class="booking-optional">(optional)</span></label>
          <textarea class="booking-input" id="q-dealbreaker" name="q_dealbreaker" rows="2"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="disc-block">
          <p class="disc-kicker">Brand &amp; voice</p>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-onesentence">Finish this sentence: when someone lands on our website, we want them to think &mdash;</label>
          <input class="booking-input" type="text" id="q-onesentence" name="q_onesentence">

          <p class="booking-label" style="margin-top:22px;">Should the site feel...</p>
          <div class="radio-row" id="voice-radio">
            <label><input type="radio" name="q_voice" value="Personal — like talking to one specific person on the team" required> Personal, like one specific person</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q_voice" value="Institutional — representing the whole business"> Institutional, the whole business</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q_voice" value="Somewhere in between"> Somewhere in between</label>
          </div>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-refs" style="margin-top:18px;">Any websites — yours or a competitor's — you specifically like, or specifically don't want to resemble? <span class="booking-optional">(optional)</span></label>
          <textarea class="booking-input" id="q-refs" name="q_refs" rows="2"></textarea>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-offlimits">Anything about your current logo, colors or name that's off-limits to change? <span class="booking-optional">(optional)</span></label>
          <textarea class="booking-input" id="q-offlimits" name="q_offlimits" rows="2"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="disc-block">
          <p class="disc-kicker">What you actually sell</p>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-makes">List the makes/brands you sell or broker most often, roughly in order</label>
          <textarea class="booking-input" id="q-makes" name="q_makes" rows="2" required></textarea>

          <p class="booking-label" style="margin-top:22px;">Which of these do your customers ask about most? Check all that apply</p>
          <div class="chk-grid" id="cat-checks">
            <!-- checkboxes injected by disc.js from CATEGORY_ITEMS -->
          </div>

          <label class="booking-label" for="q-gap" style="margin-top:18px;">Anything your customers regularly ask for that most car-shopping sites never seem to account for? <span class="booking-optional">(optional)</span></label>
          <textarea class="booking-input" id="q-gap" name="q_gap" rows="2"></textarea>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn ink" style="margin-top:8px;">Send to Dealer Flywheel</button>
        <p id="disc-status" class="disclaim" style="margin-top:10px;"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
    <p class="disclaim" style="margin-top:16px;">Prefer to talk it through instead? Email <a href="mailto:hello@dealerflywheel.com" style="color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">hello@dealerflywheel.com</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">book twenty minutes</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="/js/disc.js" defer></script>
